  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_003 (multimodal, scvi_n200, resnet50, avgpool, weighted) achieved 0.6776 validation accuracy. This experiment tests replacing scvi_n200 with scgpt (another RNA encoder) while keeping other settings identical. This clarifies whether the RNA encoder choice significantly impacts performance. It balances exploitation (building on the multimodal/multiprofile foundation) and exploration (testing a new encoder). Since RNA encoders are critical for multimodal performance, this reduces uncertainty about their impact with minimal configuration changes."  
